; Emoji: hand-drawn 11x11 pictographs.
;
; Curated rather than converted. Rasterizing a colour emoji font to one bit at
; this size produces a blob for anything with detail in it, so this set is
; restricted to shapes whose silhouette survives. A heart reads at 11px; a
; person at a laptop does not, and no threshold setting changes that.
;
; No letters here, so this face never appears in the typeface picker. It sits
; in the fallback chain instead, which is what lets a pictograph typed while
; any face is selected still draw.

id: emoji
name: Emoji
notice: Original pixel art for Badge Studio.
pickable: no

